==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|head=[[power]] [[set]]}}

# {{label|en|set theory}} The set of all [[subset]]s of a set. Notation for a set ''S'': <math>\mathcal{P}(S)</math> ''or'' 2<sup>''S''</sup>
#: ''The '''power set''' of {1, 2} is {Ø, {1}, {2}, {1,&nbsp;2}&zwnj;}''

